  "question": {
    "text": "A junction diode has a resistance of $25 \\Omega$ when forward biased and $2500 \\Omega$ when reverse biased. The current in the diode, for the arrangement shown will be\n<img src=\"assets\\qt0031_10bf1011d72c.png\"><br>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{15} \\mathrm{~A}$",
