      "text": "$\\frac{1}{7} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{25} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{180} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{R}_{\\mathrm{eq}}=25+10=35 \\Omega$\nBecause diode is forward biased. So $I=\\frac{V}{R_{e q}}=\\frac{5}{35}=\\frac{1}{7} \\mathrm{~A}$"
  }
